# Prerequisites

Install all items marked ✅ before running tests or QA scripts in this project.

---

## Always required

### Python 3.8+

Required for the QA utility scripts (`scripts/qa_track.py`, `scripts/coverage_report.py`).
These scripts are standalone — they do not depend on the test framework you chose.

| OS | Install |
|---|---|
| macOS | `brew install python3` or download from python.org |
| Windows | Download installer from https://python.org/downloads — **check "Add Python to PATH"** |
| Linux | `sudo apt install python3 python3-pip` (Debian/Ubuntu) |

Verify: `python3 --version` should print `3.8` or higher.

