{% if ui_mobile_framework == 'appium' %}

## Appium

```bash
npm install -g appium
```

Then install the driver(s) for your platform:

```bash
appium driver install uiautomator2   # Android
appium driver install xcuitest       # iOS
```

{% if ui_mobile_ios %}
**iOS** also requires Xcode (from the Mac App Store) and the Xcode Command Line Tools:
```bash
xcode-select --install
```
{% endif %}
{% if ui_mobile_android %}
**Android** also requires Android Studio (to manage AVDs and SDK):
https://developer.android.com/studio
{% endif %}

Verify: `appium --version`

{% elif ui_mobile_framework == 'detox' %}

## Detox

```bash
npm install -g detox-cli
```

{% if ui_mobile_ios %}
iOS also requires Xcode (from the Mac App Store):
```bash
